   "evidence": "M1 stories S07/S08 run a 10,000-hand random-action playtest that must exit 0 with zero violations, and S08#AC1 checks 'no street has more than 4 bets'. S05 states cap, all-ins and side pots come in M2 stories; the cap (S10, M2, deps S09) and short-stack all-in (S12, M2) are not dependencies of S07/S08. On the S05 engine random raising has no cap and a short stack has no defined behaviour, so the M1 playtest and CI playtest cannot pass as written.",
   "fix": "Move the cap (S10) and the all-in call (S12) into M1 ahead of S07/S08 (or add them as deps), or define S05's interim behaviour (cap of 4 bets, and stacks/policy guaranteeing no all-in) and state it in S05/S07."
