   "evidence": "AC3 and AC4 give no amounts: AC3 does not state the cap sequence, AC4 does not say what 'may raise' means in dollars; an implementation that ignored the cap count or half-bet reopening for unacted players could pass.",
   "fix": "AC3: flop $4/$8, seat 2 bets $4, seat 3 raises to $8, seat 4 all-in to $10 (a $2 raise), seat 5 raises to $14; Then seat 6 may only call or fold (fourth bet reached). AC4: seat 2 bets $4, seat 4 all-in $5, seat 3 yet to act; Then seat 3 may raise to $8."
